{"seq":4,"slug":"point-cloud-processing","title":"点云处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/video-and-3d/point-cloud-processing","wordCount":1245,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"点云处理\">点云处理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>点云（Point Cloud）是三维空间中的离散点集合，每个点包含三维坐标 (x, y, z) 以及可选的属性信息（颜色、法向量、反射率等）。点云数据由激光雷达（LiDAR）、深度相机（RGB-D）或多视图重建生成，是自动驾驶、机器人和三维重建的核心数据形式。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[点云数据] --&gt; B{处理方法}&#10;    B --&gt; C[基于点的方法]&#10;    B --&gt; D[基于体素的方法]&#10;    B --&gt; E[基于投影的方法]&#10;    C --&gt; F[PointNet/PointNet++]&#10;    D --&gt; G[VoxelNet/SECOND]&#10;    E --&gt; H[RangeView/BEV]&#10;    F --&gt; I[3D 理解任务]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph LR\n    A[点云数据] --&gt; B{处理方法}\n    B --&gt; C[基于点的方法]\n    B --&gt; D[基于体素的方法]\n    B --&gt; E[基于投影的方法]\n    C --&gt; F[PointNet/PointNet++]\n    D --&gt; G[VoxelNet/SECOND]\n    E --&gt; H[RangeView/BEV]\n    F --&gt; I[3D 理解任务]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><p>点云处理面临三个核心挑战：无序性（点的排列顺序不应影响结果）、稀疏性（三维空间中大部分区域没有点）和不均匀性（点的密度随距离衰减）。不同于图像的规则网格结构，点云的不规则性要求专门的网络架构设计。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表示方式</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原始点集</td>\n<td>PointNet, PointNet++</td>\n<td>保留精确坐标</td>\n<td>难以捕获局部结构</td>\n<td>分类、分割</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体素网格</td>\n<td>VoxelNet, SECOND</td>\n<td>规则结构，适合卷积</td>\n<td>量化损失，内存大</td>\n<td>3D 检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鸟瞰图</td>\n<td>PointPillars, BEVFusion</td>\n<td>高效 2D 处理</td>\n<td>丢失高度信息</td>\n<td>自动驾驶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围图</td>\n<td>RangeNet++, FIDNet</td>\n<td>适合激光雷达</td>\n<td>投影畸变</td>\n<td>语义分割</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"pointnet-与置换不变性\">PointNet 与置换不变性</h2><p>PointNet 是点云深度学习的开创性工作。它的核心思想是：通过对每个点独立应用共享的 MLP（多层感知机），再通过对称函数（最大池化）聚合所有点的特征来保证置换不变性。无论输入点的顺序如何打乱，输出结果始终相同。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class PointNet(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, num_classes):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.mlp1 = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Linear(3, 64), nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Linear(64, 128), nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Linear(128, 1024), nn.ReLU(),&#10;        )&#10;        self.classifier = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Linear(1024, 512), nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Dropout(0.3),&#10;            nn.Linear(512, 256), nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Linear(256, num_classes),&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        point_features = self.mlp1(x)&#10;        global_feature = point_features.max(dim=1)[0]&#10;        return self.classifier(global_feature)&#10;&#10;model = PointNet(num_classes=40)&#10;points = torch.randn(8, 1024, 3)&#10;logits = model(points)&#10;print(f&quot;分类输出: {logits.shape}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PointNet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, num_classes):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mlp1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.classifier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Dropout(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, num_classes),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        point_features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mlp1(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        global_feature </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> point_features.max(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.classifier(global_feature)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PointNet(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num_classes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">points </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(points)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"分类输出: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">logits.shape</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>PointNet 的局限是每个点独立处理，缺乏局部几何结构的建模能力。PointNet++ 通过层级化的 Set Abstraction 模块解决了这一问题：在点云中采样中心点，对每个中心点的邻域应用 PointNet 提取局部特征，然后逐层聚合形成层级表示。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph PointNet++ 层级架构&#10;        A[原始点云 N 点] --&gt; B[最远点采样 N/4]&#10;        B --&gt; C[球查询邻域]&#10;        C --&gt; D[局部 PointNet]&#10;        D --&gt; E[下采样特征]&#10;        E --&gt; F[再次采样 N/16]&#10;        F --&gt; G[全局特征]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph PointNet++ 层级架构\n        A[原始点云 N 点] --&gt; B[最远点采样 N/4]\n        B --&gt; C[球查询邻域]\n        C --&gt; D[局部 PointNet]\n        D --&gt; E[下采样特征]\n        E --&gt; F[再次采样 N/16]\n        F --&gt; G[全局特征]\n    end</pre><p>Point Transformer 将自注意力机制引入点云处理，使每个点能够根据与其他点的关系动态调整特征。Point Transformer V3 通过高效的序列化注意力大幅提升了处理速度，在多个点云理解基准上取得了最佳性能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"体素化与稀疏卷积\">体素化与稀疏卷积</h2><p>体素化将连续的三维空间离散化为规则的三维网格，每个体素（voxel）包含落入其中的点的聚合特征。体素表示使得三维点云可以使用类似图像的卷积操作来处理，但直接的稠密三维卷积计算量极大（O(N³)）。</p>\n<p>稀疏卷积（Sparse Convolution）是解决这一问题的关键技术。由于三维空间中大部分体素是空的（稀疏率通常 &gt;95%），稀疏卷积只在非空体素上执行卷积运算，计算量和内存消耗都大幅降低。SPConv（Spatio-temporal Sparse Convolution）库提供了高效的稀疏卷积实现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class VoxelEncoder(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_channels, voxel_size, point_cloud_range):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.voxel_size = voxel_size&#10;        self.point_cloud_range = point_cloud_range&#10;        self.pfn = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Linear(in_channels, 64),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm1d(64),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def voxelize(self, points):&#10;        coords = ((points[:, :3] - self.point_cloud_range[:3]) / self.voxel_size).int()&#10;        return coords&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, points):&#10;        coords = self.voxelize(points)&#10;        features = self.pfn(points)&#10;        return coords, features\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VoxelEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_channels, voxel_size, point_cloud_range):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.voxel_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> voxel_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.point_cloud_range </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> point_cloud_range</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pfn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(in_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.BatchNorm1d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> voxelize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, points):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        coords </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((points[:, :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.point_cloud_range[:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.voxel_size).int()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coords</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, points):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        coords </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.voxelize(points)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pfn(points)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coords, features</span></span></code></pre></div><p>SECOND（Sparsely Embedded Convolutional Detection）将稀疏卷积应用于自动驾驶的三维目标检测，实现了比 VoxelNet 快数倍的推理速度。CenterPoint 在 SECOND 的体素骨干上使用 CenterNet 的中心点检测思路，成为自动驾驶三维检测的主流方案。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>表示</th>\n<th>nuScenes mAP</th>\n<th>推理速度</th>\n<th>核心特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PointPillars</td>\n<td>柱状体素</td>\n<td>45.3</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>伪 2D 卷积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SECOND</td>\n<td>稀疏体素</td>\n<td>50.1</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>3D 稀疏卷积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CenterPoint</td>\n<td>稀疏体素</td>\n<td>59.6</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中心点检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TransFusion</td>\n<td>体素+点</td>\n<td>65.1</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>Transformer 融合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多模态三维感知\">多模态三维感知</h2><p>在自动驾驶等实际应用中，通常同时配备激光雷达和相机，两种传感器提供互补的信息：相机提供丰富的纹理和语义信息，激光雷达提供精确的三维几何信息。多模态融合将两者的优势结合，实现更强大的三维感知。</p>\n<p>BEV（Bird&#39;s Eye View）是多模态融合最流行的表示空间。相机图像通过 LSS（Lift-Splat-Shoot）或 BEVFormer 等方法投影到 BEV 空间，激光雷达点云通过体素化也转换到 BEV 空间，然后在统一的 BEV 特征图上进行融合和检测。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class BEVFusionHead(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, lidar_channels, camera_channels, out_channels):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.lidar_encoder = nn.Conv2d(lidar_channels, out_channels, 1)&#10;        self.camera_encoder = nn.Conv2d(camera_channels, out_channels, 1)&#10;        self.fusion = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(out_channels * 2, out_channels, 3, padding=1),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(out_channels),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, lidar_bev, camera_bev):&#10;        lidar_feat = self.lidar_encoder(lidar_bev)&#10;        camera_feat = self.camera_encoder(camera_bev)&#10;        fused = torch.cat([lidar_feat, camera_feat], dim=1)&#10;        return self.fusion(fused)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BEVFusionHead</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, lidar_channels, camera_channels, out_channels):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lidar_encoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv2d(lidar_channels, out_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.camera_encoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv2d(camera_channels, out_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fusion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(out_channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, out_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.BatchNorm2d(out_channels),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, lidar_bev, camera_bev):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        lidar_feat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lidar_encoder(lidar_bev)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        camera_feat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.camera_encoder(camera_bev)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        fused </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cat([lidar_feat, camera_feat], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fusion(fused)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>BEVFusion（MIT）在 BEV 空间中对齐和融合激光雷达和相机特征，通过高效的 BEV 池化操作实现了实时的多模态三维检测。UniAD 在此基础上进一步统一了检测、追踪、预测和规划四大任务，构建了端到端的自动驾驶感知-决策系统。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((点云处理))&#10;    基于点&#10;      PointNet&#10;      PointNet++&#10;      Point Transformer&#10;    体素化&#10;      稀疏卷积&#10;      SECOND&#10;      CenterPoint&#10;    多模态融合&#10;      BEV 表示&#10;      BEVFusion&#10;      UniAD\">mindmap\n  root((点云处理))\n    基于点\n      PointNet\n      PointNet++\n      Point Transformer\n    体素化\n      稀疏卷积\n      SECOND\n      CenterPoint\n    多模态融合\n      BEV 表示\n      BEVFusion\n      UniAD</pre><ul>\n<li>点云的无序性、稀疏性和不均匀性要求专门的网络设计</li>\n<li>PointNet 通过共享 MLP + 最大池化保证了置换不变性</li>\n<li>稀疏卷积是大规模点云处理的关键技术，仅在非空体素上计算</li>\n<li>CenterPoint 是自动驾驶三维检测的主流方案</li>\n<li>BEV 统一了多模态感知的表示空间，是自动驾驶感知的标准范式</li>\n<li>多模态融合（相机+激光雷达）比单一模态在安全性和精度上都有显著提升</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"点云处理","id":"点云处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"PointNet 与置换不变性","id":"pointnet-与置换不变性"},{"level":2,"text":"体素化与稀疏卷积","id":"体素化与稀疏卷积"},{"level":2,"text":"多模态三维感知","id":"多模态三维感知"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"深度估计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/video-and-3d/depth-estimation"},"next":{"title":"人脸识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/cv-applications/face-recognition"}}